.         * Generate interactive terms
.         g male=(sex==1)

.         g interaction=atleast1daughter*male

.         g interactioniv=daughterFB*male

. 
.         * For each control variable, we replace missing values with -99 and i
> nclude in our regressions dummy variables to indicate observations with origi
> nally missing values. This approach allows us to retain all observations even
>  when some control variables have missing data.
.         foreach var in sumkids age age2 agefb agefb2 {
  2.                 gen `var'_mv = 1 if `var' == . & sprogend != .
  3.                 replace `var'_mv = 0 if `var'_mv == . & `var' != . & sprog
> end != .
  4.                 replace `var' = -99 if `var' == . & sprogend != .
  5.         }
